WEBVTT

01:40.600 --> 01:42.880
- Everyone, no pushing!
- No pushing!

01:42.960 --> 01:44.120
- No grabbing!
- Don't panic!

01:44.200 --> 01:45.600
- One by one!
- I can't go over.

01:45.680 --> 01:48.160
After registration, head to the shelter.

01:48.240 --> 01:51.000
You can only survive
if you go to the shelter.

01:51.080 --> 01:53.080
Be patient! One by one!

01:53.680 --> 01:54.520
No pushing.

01:54.600 --> 01:56.440
- Don't panic!
- Wait for your turn. No pushing.

01:57.200 --> 01:58.280
There's enough for everyone.

01:59.080 --> 02:01.880
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

02:02.840 --> 02:04.680
- Thank you.
- I'm from Shang City.

02:08.759 --> 02:11.160
Have you figured out anything
after looking at it for so long?

02:16.520 --> 02:17.440
The location is wrong.

02:18.080 --> 02:18.960
What location?

02:19.040 --> 02:22.400
The location of disaster victims
coming to Dingzhou for me is not right.

02:22.480 --> 02:23.880
How so?

02:23.960 --> 02:26.800
Uncle Mingyu, we rode swiftly

02:26.880 --> 02:28.400
from Huaixiang to Dingzhou.

02:28.480 --> 02:30.920
We were also riding excellent horses.

02:31.000 --> 02:33.040
So if my saintly reputation
spread like wildfire

02:33.120 --> 02:35.120
among ordinary folks naturally,

02:35.760 --> 02:38.120
it should spread slower
than our riding speed.

02:38.840 --> 02:40.160
Logically,

02:40.840 --> 02:42.280
Dingzhou's people

02:42.360 --> 02:44.560
would only hear about me
after we left Dingzhou.

02:44.640 --> 02:47.000
You said "logically."

02:47.480 --> 02:49.600
But these folks are clearly targeting you.

02:49.680 --> 02:51.680
But the location
for targeting me is not right.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.400
Uncle Mingyu, think about it.

02:53.920 --> 02:55.600
The night we arrived in Dingzhou,

02:55.680 --> 02:58.640
many disaster victims outside the city
were already looking for me.

02:59.200 --> 03:01.560
Most of them are from elsewhere.

03:02.040 --> 03:03.720
They don't have excellent horses.

03:03.800 --> 03:05.720
All of them

03:05.800 --> 03:07.120
came on foot.

03:07.720 --> 03:10.560
Also, the ones who lived farthest
are from Ningzhou.

03:11.040 --> 03:11.880
That's right.

03:12.440 --> 03:13.400
Look.

03:13.480 --> 03:15.200
If they set out from Ningzhou to Dingzhou

03:15.280 --> 03:18.360
at the same time as us without any rest,

03:18.440 --> 03:19.360
they would only be…

03:21.120 --> 03:23.320
reaching Dingzhou's border now.

03:23.960 --> 03:26.080
So someone intentionally
gathered these disaster victims

03:26.160 --> 03:27.960
and sent them to Dingzhou.

03:28.560 --> 03:32.320
And the only county adjacent

03:32.400 --> 03:35.400
to the two heavily affected provinces,

03:35.480 --> 03:37.720
Shang City in the south
and Ningzhou in the west, is…

03:37.800 --> 03:38.880
WEI

03:38.960 --> 03:40.240
Wei County.

03:41.880 --> 03:44.480
Uncle Mingyu, I'm going to see Duke Liu.

03:47.320 --> 03:48.440
What…

03:48.520 --> 03:49.840
Ms. Jiang Li.

03:49.920 --> 03:52.000
From the disaster victims'
household registration,

03:52.080 --> 03:54.040
we found out they came from three places.

03:54.760 --> 03:55.600
Shang City,

03:56.200 --> 03:57.840
Ningzhou, and Wei County.

03:58.400 --> 03:59.880
Among them, most are from Wei County.

03:59.960 --> 04:01.360
It's nearly half of them.

04:01.440 --> 04:03.040
Half of them have arrived in Dingzhou.

04:03.520 --> 04:05.760
The population in Wei County
suddenly dropped drastically.

04:06.320 --> 04:07.240
I wonder

04:08.000 --> 04:09.280
if they have extra food.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.960
Father and I think

04:11.040 --> 04:12.760
Wei County's magistrate hasn't disclosed

04:12.840 --> 04:14.800
the sudden decrease
in Wei County's population

04:14.880 --> 04:17.279
because he is hoarding food,

04:17.360 --> 04:19.600
leading to famine
and causing the people to go hungry.

04:20.160 --> 04:22.720
And some are spreading rumors
about your saintly reputation,

04:22.800 --> 04:24.360
leading to the sudden surge of refugees

04:24.440 --> 04:26.000
from Wei County to Dingzhou.

04:26.080 --> 04:29.280
Maybe the magistrate is being manipulated

04:29.360 --> 04:32.360
or there's an emergency in Wei County.

04:32.440 --> 04:36.040
To be honest, I'm suspicious
of Wei County too.

04:37.240 --> 04:39.600
Someone is redirecting
disaster victims to Dingzhou.

04:41.240 --> 04:43.000
If we can catch one or two people

04:43.080 --> 04:44.640
who were stirring up trouble before

04:44.720 --> 04:45.800
and interrogate them,

04:45.880 --> 04:48.040
maybe we can find out who's behind them.

04:48.120 --> 04:50.480
When the disaster victims surrounded
the courtyard last night,

04:50.560 --> 04:51.680
I had the same idea too.

04:52.240 --> 04:54.600
But these troublemakers are too cunning.

04:55.160 --> 04:57.040
It's quite hard to find them

04:57.120 --> 04:58.680
from the crowd.

05:00.400 --> 05:01.560
There's no need to find them.

05:02.400 --> 05:04.240
We'll set a trap to lure them out.

05:04.320 --> 05:06.120
A trap? What kind of trap?

05:06.960 --> 05:09.320
Duke Liu,
I want to leave the city for a bit.

05:09.400 --> 05:11.360
Leave the city at this time?

05:11.440 --> 05:13.880
That's not a good idea.
It's too dangerous.

05:13.960 --> 05:14.960
- Absolutely not.
- Right.

05:16.280 --> 05:17.600
Nothing ventured,

05:19.080 --> 05:20.080
nothing gained.

05:21.520 --> 05:26.440
DINGZHOU

05:33.360 --> 05:34.200
Stop the carriage!

05:34.960 --> 05:37.680
Folks, I know this person.

05:37.760 --> 05:39.240
He is with Ms. Jiang Li.

05:40.080 --> 05:41.920
Ms. Jiang Li is trying to leave.

05:42.000 --> 05:44.240
Folks, we can't let her leave!

05:44.320 --> 05:45.640
Or no one will help us!

05:47.200 --> 05:48.720
Who do you think Ms. Jiang Li is?

05:49.280 --> 05:52.320
A coward like you who talks tough
among the crowd?

05:52.400 --> 05:53.240
Listen here.

05:53.720 --> 05:55.720
Ms. Jiang Li is leaving the city
to get food.

05:56.760 --> 05:57.960
If anyone dares to stop her,

05:58.600 --> 06:00.360
don't blame me for being ruthless!

06:07.240 --> 06:09.000
These officials are best
at deceiving people.

06:09.080 --> 06:10.400
We're all going to starve anyway.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.400
Why not take a chance?

06:11.480 --> 06:13.520
Let's abduct the Chancellor's daughter
in exchange for food!

06:13.600 --> 06:15.720
He's right! These people are all liars!

06:15.800 --> 06:18.040
Exchange her for food!

06:18.120 --> 06:22.600
- Exchange her for food!
- Exchange her for food!

06:22.680 --> 06:24.600
- Exchange her for food!
- Let's see who dares to stop the carriage!

06:25.080 --> 06:26.080
You?

06:27.320 --> 06:28.680
You?

06:29.920 --> 06:30.840
You?

06:32.040 --> 06:33.000
Or you?

06:58.120 --> 06:59.920
Arrest the agitators.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.880
Spreading rumors
and sabotaging disaster relief efforts

07:01.960 --> 07:03.280
are considered acts of treason.

07:03.360 --> 07:04.520
We're ordered to arrest you.

07:04.600 --> 07:06.560
Those who are not involved, leave now!

07:07.520 --> 07:09.280
- Come on.
- Let's go.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.800
I told you not to stop the carriage.

07:16.880 --> 07:18.240
But you refused to listen.

07:27.960 --> 07:28.800
Jiang Li,

07:28.880 --> 07:31.120
do you think Duke Su
and the others can catch them?

07:31.200 --> 07:33.280
Since the day I've known him,

07:33.960 --> 07:35.280
he has never failed.

07:35.960 --> 07:38.640
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.720
What if you get killed?

07:44.240 --> 07:45.200
- Duke Su.
- Duke Su.

07:48.520 --> 07:51.920
Pack your things.
Take Xue Huaiyuan and come with me.

07:52.000 --> 07:53.480
I'll ensure your safe entry
into the capital.

07:53.560 --> 07:56.480
If I wanted to leave,
I could have done so yesterday.

07:56.960 --> 07:58.360
But now, my…

08:00.520 --> 08:01.960
Magistrate Xue refuses to leave.

08:02.040 --> 08:03.800
Has he regained his lucidity?

08:05.000 --> 08:05.840
No.

08:05.920 --> 08:08.440
Then why listen to someone
who has no mental clarity?

08:08.520 --> 08:09.480
Duke Su.

08:14.760 --> 08:15.920
Please mind with your words.

08:36.679 --> 08:37.720
Dingzhou

08:38.559 --> 08:40.360
is in trouble now because of me.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.880
I can't just leave like this.

08:43.440 --> 08:46.200
Moreover, we're starting
to get some clues.

08:46.280 --> 08:47.760
It's time to unravel things.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.520
I won't let this go for nothing.

08:50.600 --> 08:51.800
Have you forgotten

08:51.880 --> 08:53.960
what's more important to you now?

08:55.520 --> 08:56.760
I know that better than anyone.

08:57.640 --> 09:00.040
Dingzhou and Huaixiang's
disaster victims are the same.

09:00.120 --> 09:02.480
They've ended up like this
because of persecution.

09:03.440 --> 09:05.240
The tragedy of the Xue family

09:05.760 --> 09:07.880
is also a result of those power struggles.

09:08.520 --> 09:09.680
For me,

09:09.760 --> 09:12.120
clearing the Xue family's name
is not enough.

09:12.200 --> 09:14.240
I must expose
the real mastermind behind all this.

09:15.080 --> 09:15.960
Only by doing this

09:16.760 --> 09:18.400
can we prevent the Xue family's tragedy

09:18.480 --> 09:19.320
from happening

09:19.800 --> 09:21.320
to other people again.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.880
Have you made up your mind?

09:26.960 --> 09:27.880
Yes.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.320
Then I'll leave the city on your behalf.

09:32.560 --> 09:34.840
Why was Duke Su here yesterday?

09:36.640 --> 09:37.720
You can ask him yourself.

09:37.800 --> 09:38.760
I dare not provoke him.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.720
But you look pretty close.

09:42.800 --> 09:44.400
How could you not know?

09:44.480 --> 09:46.280
No wonder Ye Shijie got appointed

09:46.360 --> 09:47.840
while you accomplished nothing.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.800
So you spend your efforts
on things like these.

09:49.880 --> 09:50.720
I…

09:52.360 --> 09:53.760
Everyone has their strengths.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.800
Jiang Jingrui never aimed
to be an official.

10:03.800 --> 10:05.480
Why are you staring at me?

10:07.160 --> 10:09.000
Forget it. I have to leave now.

10:09.080 --> 10:10.760
I'll go ask my father

10:11.240 --> 10:12.080
if they found them.

10:14.440 --> 10:17.120
Liu Xu, you know me too well.

10:27.880 --> 10:28.720
It's confirmed.

10:29.200 --> 10:31.960
Lu Ziyun, Wei County's magistrate,
orchestrated the trouble in Dingzhou.

10:32.040 --> 10:34.000
They embezzled relief grains
from the imperial court

10:34.080 --> 10:35.800
and directed disaster victims to Dingzhou.

10:35.880 --> 10:37.840
Duke Liu, you should know
what to do now, right?

10:37.920 --> 10:41.320
Thank you for your assistance, Duke Su.
I got it now.

10:41.400 --> 10:42.880
I'll handle the matters in Wei County.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.760
Handle the evacuation
of Dingzhou's disaster victims.

10:44.840 --> 10:46.120
Yes, Duke Su.

11:05.440 --> 11:07.200
I knew there was something between them.

11:07.280 --> 11:08.280
For sure.

11:10.680 --> 11:13.120
- Hey, mind your words.
- Don't bad-mouth my niece. Come here.

11:13.200 --> 11:15.280
Is everything in Huaixiang sorted out?

11:15.360 --> 11:16.240
No.

11:16.720 --> 11:18.240
Then why did you get here so quickly?

11:20.880 --> 11:21.840
What do you think?

11:24.480 --> 11:26.080
Just a reminder.

11:26.160 --> 11:27.600
After finding Xue Huaiyuan,

11:27.680 --> 11:29.280
you seem a bit too emotional.

11:29.360 --> 11:31.400
It's better for you to hold it in a bit.

11:31.480 --> 11:32.320
All right.

11:32.840 --> 11:33.720
I'm leaving now.

11:34.920 --> 11:36.440
Is there anything you want to tell me?

11:39.720 --> 11:40.600
Be careful

11:41.760 --> 11:42.880
when you leave tomorrow.

11:50.160 --> 11:51.480
Like I said before,

11:51.560 --> 11:53.800
stay calm, Ms. Jiang Li.

12:07.080 --> 12:09.760
CATCH EVERYONE'S ATTENTION

12:09.840 --> 12:10.680
Liu Xu,

12:12.680 --> 12:13.720
all the food

12:15.360 --> 12:16.200
is here.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.760
Let's distribute these tomorrow.

12:20.840 --> 12:22.200
Don't touch the rest.

12:22.280 --> 12:23.760
We must make it last for three days.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.280
It should be enough for three days.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.440
Once Wei County's issue is resolved,

12:27.520 --> 12:30.000
food won't be a problem.

12:30.080 --> 12:32.520
It's not every day
I get to see you being this serious.

12:32.600 --> 12:34.160
I'm a bit impressed.

12:41.120 --> 12:43.160
What did you think

12:43.240 --> 12:44.200
I was like before?

12:44.280 --> 12:46.000
You used to carry a turtle
with you all day

12:46.080 --> 12:47.240
and weren't keen on learning.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.400
Unexpectedly, in a crisis,

12:48.960 --> 12:50.040
you're pretty reliable.

12:56.840 --> 12:58.880
I've always been reliable, all right?

12:59.560 --> 13:01.080
I'll put all the food in place for you.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.640
Is she going to confess
her feelings to me?

13:16.360 --> 13:17.240
What's the matter?

13:17.760 --> 13:18.880
You're lacking strength.

13:18.960 --> 13:21.040
Always dilly-dallying.
When will you finish moving them?

13:31.400 --> 13:33.200
JIANG RESIDENCE

13:33.280 --> 13:34.120
- Here.
- Here.

13:35.560 --> 13:36.560
He didn't eat again?

13:36.640 --> 13:37.480
Yes.

13:40.280 --> 13:42.760
Hasn't his lordship eaten much these days?

13:42.840 --> 13:44.720
Yes. Not a single bite.

13:44.800 --> 13:46.280
Not a bite?

13:46.360 --> 13:48.480
His lordship is discussing matters
with his aides

13:48.560 --> 13:49.840
and doesn't want to be disturbed.

13:52.440 --> 13:55.080
Skipping meals is not good.

13:58.400 --> 13:59.880
You should eat something.

13:59.960 --> 14:01.840
No matter what happens,
your health is important.

14:03.520 --> 14:04.440
I have no appetite.

14:11.440 --> 14:13.840
Are the roads in Dingzhou still blocked?

14:14.400 --> 14:16.680
It's nice of you to even worry about this.

14:18.560 --> 14:20.760
We just got the news

14:21.640 --> 14:24.600
that Dingzhou's disaster victims
have blocked the city's gate.

14:24.680 --> 14:27.080
No one inside can get out.

14:27.160 --> 14:29.120
And Li Zhongnan refuses
to distribute the food.

14:29.760 --> 14:32.720
They're pushing Li'er to her death there.

14:32.800 --> 14:34.480
The Ye family also went to Dingzhou.

14:34.560 --> 14:36.800
I don't think
they'd make things difficult for Li'er.

14:36.880 --> 14:39.560
That's why I'm not only
worried about this.

14:39.640 --> 14:42.200
Even if they manage to leave Dingzhou,

14:42.280 --> 14:45.160
what will happen
after they return to the capital?

14:45.720 --> 14:47.360
Breaking a prisoner out of jail
is a serious crime.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.720
Will the Court of Judicial Review
let Li'er off?

14:49.800 --> 14:52.640
And will Li Zhongnan let me off?

14:57.960 --> 14:59.120
WEI COUNTY GRANARY, GRAIN

14:59.200 --> 15:04.320
WEI COUNTY

15:09.040 --> 15:10.400
Stop right there. Who are you?

15:28.840 --> 15:34.240
WEI COUNTY GRANARY, GRAIN

15:36.000 --> 15:38.040
My lord, there's grain left
in the granary indeed.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.120
It's the relief grain
from the imperial court.

15:40.200 --> 15:42.200
But Lu Ziyun has fled.

15:46.840 --> 15:48.720
We've counted the provisions.
There's not a lot.

15:48.800 --> 15:50.520
But it should relieve the urgent need now.

15:51.080 --> 15:52.760
But everything went too smoothly.

15:52.840 --> 15:54.160
The granary wasn't burned.

15:54.240 --> 15:56.000
We weren't clearly obstructed too.

15:56.080 --> 15:58.400
It was like everything was waiting for us.

16:00.160 --> 16:02.280
Do you think I'm overthinking?

16:02.360 --> 16:03.840
With the secret guards in action,

16:03.920 --> 16:05.040
it should go smoothly, right?

16:08.360 --> 16:09.840
It's just a trick to lure us away.

16:10.760 --> 16:11.960
Why can't you sell them?

16:12.040 --> 16:13.520
I'll pay double, all right?

16:14.040 --> 16:16.640
Vice Director Ye,
it's not that I don't want to sell them.

16:16.720 --> 16:19.680
The imperial court just requisitioned
the Luyang Granary for disaster relief.

16:19.760 --> 16:20.880
All the grain in our shop

16:21.360 --> 16:22.920
belongs to the imperial court now.

16:23.000 --> 16:24.800
They're sealed
and waiting to be transported.

16:24.880 --> 16:26.200
If I sell them to you,

16:26.280 --> 16:27.920
that would be trafficking
government grain.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.360
That's punishable by death.

16:29.440 --> 16:30.280
But…

16:30.360 --> 16:32.240
Shijie, let's move on.

16:32.320 --> 16:33.360
We'll check other places.

16:36.640 --> 16:39.480
ZHANG'S GRAIN MILL

16:39.560 --> 16:40.920
Sirs,

16:41.000 --> 16:42.960
we dare not transport this grain.

16:43.880 --> 16:45.280
Just name your price.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.880
It's not about the money.

16:47.440 --> 16:49.560
Our men said
there are checkpoints on the roads,

16:49.640 --> 16:51.960
which strictly inspect
reselling grains for personal gain.

16:52.040 --> 16:54.240
If they accuse us of that,

16:54.320 --> 16:55.880
who can we turn to?

16:55.960 --> 16:57.760
We've always gotten our goods from you.

16:57.840 --> 16:59.560
- You can't do business this way.
- Shijie.

17:00.800 --> 17:01.680
Let's go.

17:01.760 --> 17:02.760
If nothing else works,

17:02.840 --> 17:05.359
let's check our family's transport carts
to see if they're enough.

17:06.839 --> 17:07.680
All right.

17:12.359 --> 17:15.839
Any movement on Jiang Yuanbai's end?

17:16.400 --> 17:17.680
No.

17:17.760 --> 17:18.680
I heard

17:18.760 --> 17:20.880
he's still discussing things
with his aides every day.

17:20.960 --> 17:22.720
What's the use of discussing?

17:23.720 --> 17:26.560
Unless he grows wings
and flies to Dingzhou

17:26.640 --> 17:28.760
to bring Jiang Li back,

17:29.840 --> 17:32.280
it'll be hard for them to overcome this.

17:32.360 --> 17:33.640
What about Xiao Heng?

17:33.720 --> 17:35.680
He fell for the trap.
He went to Wei County.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.200
And the Ye family?

17:37.760 --> 17:39.880
They're looking for grains in Luyang,

17:39.960 --> 17:41.840
but to no avail.

17:41.920 --> 17:42.880
So

17:44.640 --> 17:47.240
Jiang Li in Dingzhou is…

17:47.320 --> 17:50.360
She's now completely isolated,
like a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.

17:58.360 --> 17:59.200
Chancellor Li, here.

18:01.360 --> 18:03.400
There's enough for everyone.
Line up, no pushing.

18:03.480 --> 18:05.120
Why are you cutting in line?
Don't do that.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.720
- No, I'm just looking.
- What's going on?

18:06.800 --> 18:08.440
Didn't I say everyone will get some?

18:10.000 --> 18:11.880
There's enough for everyone. Be patient.

18:11.960 --> 18:13.480
- Line up and be patient.
- Thank you.

18:13.560 --> 18:14.600
You can get food here too.

18:15.080 --> 18:16.640
There's enough for everyone.

18:17.840 --> 18:19.200
Everyone will get food. Be patient.

18:20.440 --> 18:21.520
You can line up here too.

18:22.720 --> 18:23.680
Let them get it for you.

18:24.960 --> 18:27.200
- There's plenty, no pushing.
- Someone died of hunger!

18:27.680 --> 18:29.160
Someone is dead from hunger!

18:29.240 --> 18:31.560
Come and see. Someone died of hunger!

18:32.440 --> 18:33.440
Come and take a look!

18:33.920 --> 18:36.440
The relief congee
in the city is too watery.

18:36.520 --> 18:39.480
- At this rate, we'll all starve to death!
- He's right.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.520
- Am I right?
- Make way.

18:40.600 --> 18:41.800
- How can we eat this?
- Make way.

18:41.880 --> 18:44.080
- What happened?
- Is this water or congee?

18:44.160 --> 18:45.840
It's so watery
that it's not filling at all.

18:45.920 --> 18:48.200
Yes, someone already died.
Do you want to starve us to death?

18:50.320 --> 18:52.440
Also, did you give Dingzhou's grains

18:52.520 --> 18:53.760
to the people outside the city?

18:53.840 --> 18:55.360
No, don't make baseless accusations.

18:55.440 --> 18:57.600
- Then where are the grains?
- Isn't Ms. Jiang Li a saint?

18:57.680 --> 18:58.960
Why is she hiding?

18:59.040 --> 19:01.200
Are our lives not important?

19:01.280 --> 19:02.400
- Yes, that's right.
- Right.

19:02.480 --> 19:04.680
- Everyone, calm down. It's not like that.
- Calm down!

19:04.760 --> 19:05.880
We came to Dingzhou

19:05.960 --> 19:08.080
because we believed in Ms. Jiang Li.

19:08.160 --> 19:09.360
But since we arrived,

19:09.440 --> 19:10.760
we've been starving every day.

19:10.840 --> 19:12.080
Now, someone died of hunger.

19:12.160 --> 19:13.400
We want to see Ms. Jiang Li.

19:13.480 --> 19:14.520
Call her out.

19:14.600 --> 19:15.880
- Call her out!
- It's not like that.

19:15.960 --> 19:17.880
- Everyone, calm down.
- Calm down.

19:17.960 --> 19:20.240
- Please calm down.
- It's not like that.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.040
- This is bad. Close the city gates.
- Calm down!

19:22.120 --> 19:23.520
- Everyone, calm down.
- Calm down.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.840
Liu Xu, leave now.

19:26.960 --> 19:27.920
Go quickly.

19:29.800 --> 19:32.000
Everyone, listen to me. Please calm down.

19:32.080 --> 19:34.640
Jiang Jingrui!
Open the gate. He's still outside.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.920
- Too many disaster victims are outside.
- Open it!

19:37.000 --> 19:38.840
- We're understaffed. We can't handle them.
- Open up!

19:41.160 --> 19:42.000
It's not like that.

19:43.520 --> 19:46.040
Everyone, calm down.
You must calm down. Listen to me.

19:47.760 --> 19:49.680
It's not what you think.

19:49.760 --> 19:50.640
Jiang Li,

19:51.680 --> 19:53.200
come with me to the government office
to take shelter.

19:53.280 --> 19:55.440
More and more disaster victims
are gathering outside.

19:55.520 --> 19:57.080
They're asking you to go out.

19:57.160 --> 19:58.920
I fear people inside the city
will cause trouble too.

19:59.000 --> 20:00.440
It seems like we haven't caught

20:00.520 --> 20:01.680
all the instigators yet.

20:01.760 --> 20:03.760
They're already eager to take action.

20:03.840 --> 20:05.200
Aren't Liu Xu and my cousin

20:05.280 --> 20:06.840
distributing porridge at the gate today?

20:06.920 --> 20:07.960
How are they doing?

20:08.040 --> 20:10.400
I heard Jiang Jingrui
is trapped outside the city.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.360
What?

20:13.560 --> 20:15.880
Uncle Mingyu, bring Magistrate Xue
to the government office.

20:15.960 --> 20:16.840
I'll go out of the city.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.480
These people are clearly aiming at you.

20:18.560 --> 20:19.440
That's precisely why

20:19.520 --> 20:21.280
I can't let my cousin suffer for me.

20:21.360 --> 20:24.240
Why not let Tong'er bring Magistrate Xue
to the government office?

20:24.320 --> 20:25.800
I'll go out of the city with you.

20:27.920 --> 20:32.280
Uncle Mingyu,
it will be a little dangerous from now on.

20:32.840 --> 20:34.880
When have I ever been afraid of danger?

20:34.960 --> 20:36.400
Even if it's dangerous,

20:36.480 --> 20:37.440
I'll go with you.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.560
Everyone, calm down!

20:39.640 --> 20:41.080
It's Ms. Jiang Li!

20:41.160 --> 20:43.440
It's Ms. Jiang Li!

20:43.520 --> 20:44.920
Ms. Jiang Li finally came out.

20:45.000 --> 20:47.320
- Ms. Jiang Li.
- Ms. Jiang Li.

20:47.400 --> 20:50.320
Saint, please help us.

20:50.400 --> 20:53.080
Help us who left our hometowns.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.600
Please help us.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.840
Quiet down!

20:56.480 --> 20:57.440
Get up!

20:57.520 --> 20:58.840
- Get up!
- Folks.

20:59.520 --> 21:02.040
I know the famine in Dingzhou is serious.

21:02.120 --> 21:04.120
The imperial court's relief grain
is on its way.

21:04.200 --> 21:05.640
In two days at most,

21:05.720 --> 21:07.200
the famine in Dingzhou will be eased.

21:07.280 --> 21:09.560
Are we supposed to wait
until we starve to death?

21:09.640 --> 21:11.760
He's right. We've been waiting so long.

21:11.840 --> 21:13.560
- Right!
- Since you've come to me,

21:13.640 --> 21:15.080
it means you trust me.

21:15.160 --> 21:16.280
Listen to what I have to say.

21:16.840 --> 21:18.680
Even if there was also famine in Dingzhou,

21:18.760 --> 21:20.600
the grain in the city was enough.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.560
But now, look for yourselves.

21:22.640 --> 21:24.800
Many more disaster victims
are in and out of the city.

21:24.880 --> 21:27.520
Even if we empty two granaries
in Dingzhou,

21:27.600 --> 21:28.680
it won't be enough.

21:28.760 --> 21:31.960
Many of you are from Wei County.

21:32.040 --> 21:33.360
The imperial court's relief grains

21:33.840 --> 21:35.600
arrived in Wei County months ago.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.520
But Wei County became a place
with no grain.

21:37.600 --> 21:39.360
Where did the grains go?

21:39.440 --> 21:41.640
It could only be hoarded
by corrupt officials.

21:41.720 --> 21:43.280
Think again.

21:43.360 --> 21:45.640
Who made you leave your homes
and come to Dingzhou?

21:48.960 --> 21:51.360
We've already investigated Wei County.

21:51.440 --> 21:53.280
Even if you were deceived by villains,

21:54.080 --> 21:55.400
you have no way to go now.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.800
The grains in Dingzhou can support us

21:57.880 --> 22:00.120
until the relief grain arrives.

22:00.880 --> 22:03.120
I won't leave the city alone.

22:03.200 --> 22:06.320
I will stay here in Dingzhou
and face the famine with you.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.280
Everyone,

22:07.360 --> 22:09.720
the grains will arrive
in two days at most.

22:09.800 --> 22:11.000
- We don't believe you.
- Yes!

22:11.080 --> 22:12.720
If we don't get grain today,

22:12.800 --> 22:14.320
we'll cause trouble and we won't stop!

22:14.400 --> 22:16.120
- Yes, we'll cause trouble.
- Give us grain.

22:16.200 --> 22:17.880
Do you see that?

22:17.960 --> 22:19.840
These people have lost their minds
from hunger.

22:19.920 --> 22:21.640
They don't buy what you've said.

22:21.720 --> 22:23.120
Again?

22:23.880 --> 22:25.120
Open the gates.

22:25.200 --> 22:26.280
Is Liu Xu coming?

22:26.360 --> 22:27.720
Open the gates quickly.

22:27.800 --> 22:28.840
Open the gates now!

22:30.680 --> 22:31.840
- Back off!
- Back off!

22:31.920 --> 22:32.880
Back off!

22:34.280 --> 22:36.600
Back off! If you cause more trouble,
I'll arrest all of you!

22:36.680 --> 22:38.160
The soldiers are bullying the people.

22:38.240 --> 22:40.080
We outnumber you. We're not afraid of you!

22:40.160 --> 22:42.040
We're not scared of you!
Don't be afraid of them!

22:42.120 --> 22:45.200
- We're not scared of you!
- Uncle Mingyu, arrest those two in front.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.200
- What are you doing?
- Come with me!

22:49.840 --> 22:51.000
Come with me!

22:54.560 --> 22:56.160
- He killed him! Someone is dead!
- You…

22:56.240 --> 22:58.760
- A soldier killed him!
- A soldier killed him!

22:58.840 --> 23:01.040
- I…
- Capture Ms. Jiang Li!

23:01.120 --> 23:03.080
Ms. Jiang Li
is a high-ranking official's daughter!

23:03.160 --> 23:05.200
If we catch her,
we'll definitely get food!

23:05.280 --> 23:07.400
Do you know the crime of harming
the Chancellor's daughter?

23:07.480 --> 23:09.040
The law can't punish numerous offenders.

23:09.120 --> 23:10.920
You can't kill us all, right?

23:11.000 --> 23:13.120
Everyone, go and get Ms. Jiang Li now!

23:13.960 --> 23:15.600
- Get her!
- What are you doing?

23:15.680 --> 23:17.360
- Get her!
- Move back!

23:17.440 --> 23:18.640
We'll have food if we get her!

23:18.720 --> 23:20.200
- Back off!
- Get Ms. Jiang Li!

23:20.280 --> 23:22.000
Get Ms. Jiang Li!

23:22.080 --> 23:24.200
- Back off!
- Capture her!

23:26.160 --> 23:27.080
Move back!

23:27.160 --> 23:28.120
The grains are here!

23:29.160 --> 23:30.400
The grains have arrived.

23:30.480 --> 23:31.960
The grains are here!

23:32.520 --> 23:33.640
The grains have arrived.

23:34.360 --> 23:35.520
The grains are here!

23:35.600 --> 23:37.200
- It's Ye Shijie.
- The grains are here!

23:37.720 --> 23:38.880
The grains have arrived.

23:44.000 --> 23:45.720
Unload the carts. Hurry up.

23:45.800 --> 23:47.160
We're saved.

23:51.720 --> 23:52.680
The grains have arrived.

23:52.760 --> 23:53.840
We're saved.

24:05.400 --> 24:07.040
Get up.

24:07.120 --> 24:08.680
Why are you arresting me?

24:09.160 --> 24:10.200
- I said get up.
- Be gentle.

24:10.280 --> 24:11.160
You want to run?

24:11.240 --> 24:12.920
No, I won't run.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.000
Everyone, calm down.

24:14.080 --> 24:15.680
Line up. Everyone will get some.

24:15.760 --> 24:17.400
- Here.
- Don't worry. You'll get your food.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.400
Don't drop it.

24:18.480 --> 24:20.520
- Thank you. Thank you so much.
- Let's check the front.

24:20.600 --> 24:21.440
Jiang Li,

24:22.680 --> 24:23.560
I came late.

24:26.120 --> 24:27.120
You're not, Jia'er.

24:27.200 --> 24:28.120
It's all thanks to you.

24:28.200 --> 24:30.280
Or it'll be difficult to settle this.

24:30.360 --> 24:31.640
Don't say that.

24:31.720 --> 24:33.640
The Ye family owes you this.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.600
You deserve it.

24:36.320 --> 24:37.400
- Shijie.
- Line up properly.

24:37.920 --> 24:38.760
- Here.
- Thank you.

24:38.840 --> 24:40.320
Not bad, Ye Shijie.

24:40.400 --> 24:42.480
How did you get so much grain
in such a short time?

24:42.560 --> 24:43.720
If I weren't confident,

24:43.800 --> 24:45.200
I wouldn't have left.

24:45.280 --> 24:46.480
Shijie wrote to me

24:46.560 --> 24:47.800
before returning.

24:47.880 --> 24:50.120
He said you'd pass through Dingzhou.

24:50.200 --> 24:51.720
But with the famine,

24:51.800 --> 24:54.440
some people might use this chance
to cause trouble for you.

24:54.520 --> 24:56.160
So we started preparing

24:56.240 --> 24:57.520
from that moment.

24:59.520 --> 25:01.400
Jiang Li might be trapped in Dingzhou.

25:01.480 --> 25:03.640
Shijie asked us
to think of a way to help her.

25:10.640 --> 25:13.680
Mr. Ye, we had some cash before.

25:13.760 --> 25:16.200
But it's all spent
on raw materials and labor.

25:16.280 --> 25:17.880
Mortgage Lizheng Hall first

25:17.960 --> 25:18.880
to borrow some money.

25:19.840 --> 25:21.080
Don't forget my jewelry too.

25:21.160 --> 25:22.200
Saving lives comes first.

25:23.120 --> 25:25.160
Ms. Jia'er, must you go to Cangzhou
to gather grains?

25:25.240 --> 25:27.400
The prices there are much higher
than in Luyang.

25:27.480 --> 25:28.640
I asked the escort agency.

25:28.720 --> 25:30.280
They've set up temporary checkpoints

25:30.360 --> 25:31.520
between Luyang and Dingzhou.

25:31.600 --> 25:32.920
If the Ye family transports grain,

25:33.000 --> 25:34.280
they'll accuse us of reselling

25:34.360 --> 25:35.200
and confiscate them.

25:35.760 --> 25:38.320
Even if we gather grain in Luyang,
we can't move it there.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.720
Also, Shijie said

25:40.360 --> 25:42.600
not to let anyone know
the Ye family is collecting grain.

25:42.680 --> 25:44.680
My trip to Cangzhou
should be kept a secret too.

25:44.760 --> 25:45.600
Understood.

25:49.360 --> 25:50.240
Shijie,

25:50.320 --> 25:51.840
how did you know all this in advance?

25:51.920 --> 25:53.560
I received a secret letter.

25:54.520 --> 25:55.680
And you trusted it?

25:55.760 --> 25:57.600
What if someone gives you
fake information?

25:57.680 --> 25:59.920
If it were from anyone else,
I wouldn't trust it.

26:02.040 --> 26:02.920
But…

26:05.760 --> 26:07.760
DUKE SU

26:15.880 --> 26:17.560
The Ye family is so lucky.

26:17.640 --> 26:19.640
There are checkpoints everywhere.

26:19.720 --> 26:21.680
Yet they managed to transport grains
from Cangzhou.

26:21.760 --> 26:22.960
They're not lucky.

26:23.040 --> 26:24.840
It's part of his lordship's plan.

26:24.920 --> 26:26.400
He even predicted all of this.

26:26.480 --> 26:29.040
The Duke Mansion didn't only
send secret letters to Ye Shijie

26:29.120 --> 26:30.320
but also to the Jiang family.

26:31.640 --> 26:33.440
"Secretly ensure
the Ye family's relief grains

26:33.520 --> 26:35.320
get transported from Cangzhou."

26:37.760 --> 26:39.720
Do you understand what this means?

26:39.800 --> 26:41.920
Li Zhongnan has set up checkpoints
on the routes

26:42.000 --> 26:42.880
to Dingzhou.

26:42.960 --> 26:45.640
It's to prevent any grain relief
that can help Ms. Jiang Li

26:45.720 --> 26:46.680
from entering Dingzhou.

26:46.760 --> 26:49.560
However, only the Governor of Cangzhou
is on our side.

26:50.160 --> 26:52.760
Will the Ye family
really go to such lengths

26:52.840 --> 26:55.040
and pay a high price
to procure grain from Cangzhou?

26:55.120 --> 26:57.400
We don't have a better option
at this moment.

26:57.480 --> 26:59.840
It's better to assume they will.

27:00.640 --> 27:02.400
Send my message to Cangzhou urgently.

27:02.480 --> 27:05.520
Ensure that the Ye family's relief grains
arrive in Dingzhou without problems.

27:05.600 --> 27:08.480
But how do we do this secretly?

27:08.560 --> 27:09.560
How?

27:09.640 --> 27:11.640
We'll put on an act for Li Zhongnan

27:11.720 --> 27:14.280
to make him think that I, Jiang Yuanbai,

27:15.000 --> 27:17.080
am at a loss this time.

27:17.160 --> 27:19.240
So his lordship played a diversion tactic.

27:19.320 --> 27:21.240
Was our visit to Wei County
also part of the act?

27:21.320 --> 27:23.240
They wanted to lure us out of Dingzhou.

27:23.920 --> 27:26.080
If we didn't fall into the trap
they set in Wei County,

27:26.640 --> 27:29.160
they'd suspect that his lordship already
has a response strategy.

27:29.640 --> 27:31.720
Then they might shift
their focus to the Ye family.

27:31.800 --> 27:34.040
Only the Ye family
can resolve this crisis.

27:34.560 --> 27:35.720
If they were really targeted,

27:36.320 --> 27:37.960
the grains might not make it through.

27:38.040 --> 27:40.000
Why didn't his lordship just go with you?

27:40.080 --> 27:41.880
Why involve me in this act?

27:41.960 --> 27:43.480
I wasn't even informed of this.

27:43.560 --> 27:44.440
If we stayed,

27:45.120 --> 27:46.880
they would surely be cautious

27:46.960 --> 27:49.000
and wouldn't instigate their spies
in the city to cause trouble.

27:49.080 --> 27:50.960
- We're not scared of you!
- How did this happen in Dingzhou?

27:51.040 --> 27:52.600
We need to get information from them.

27:52.680 --> 27:54.520
What if the Ye family
doesn't make it in time?

27:55.320 --> 27:58.160
- Does his lordship have a backup plan?
- His lordship believes Ms. Jiang Li

27:58.240 --> 28:00.120
can definitely wait
until the Ye family arrives.

28:00.200 --> 28:02.640
Did he discuss
this plan with Ms. Jiang Li before?

28:02.720 --> 28:03.560
No.

28:03.640 --> 28:04.560
But they

28:05.760 --> 28:07.160
probably have a tacit understanding.

28:07.240 --> 28:10.280
Lu Ji, you've become mischievous.

28:10.360 --> 28:11.840
A man is known by the company he keeps.

28:20.360 --> 28:21.920
Were you looking for me, Your Highness?

28:22.440 --> 28:23.840
Have you heard?

28:23.920 --> 28:27.200
Jiang Li is bringing Huaixiang's people
to the capital to petition to His Majesty.

28:27.280 --> 28:28.160
I've heard about it.

28:28.640 --> 28:30.080
She's also bringing someone.

28:30.560 --> 28:32.000
Huaixiang's county magistrate,

28:33.160 --> 28:34.320
Xue Huaiyuan.

28:37.360 --> 28:39.360
It seems you already know this.

28:40.360 --> 28:42.480
That's why you're not surprised at all.

28:42.560 --> 28:44.360
I've only heard it mentioned
by the students.

28:45.920 --> 28:49.840
How do you plan to deal with her then?

28:50.720 --> 28:53.560
Aren't you going to ask
why Xue Huaiyuan is alive

28:53.640 --> 28:55.120
or if we managed

28:55.200 --> 28:56.400
to keep our gold mine?

28:56.480 --> 28:59.080
You're only concerned
about how I'll deal with her.

29:06.040 --> 29:08.240
She broke a prisoner out.

29:08.320 --> 29:11.080
Court of Judicial Review officials
are waiting for her at the city gate.

29:11.160 --> 29:14.040
As soon as she enters the city,
she'll be thrown in prison.

29:14.120 --> 29:15.920
Are you worried

29:16.000 --> 29:17.640
because you're afraid she might suffer?

29:17.720 --> 29:19.520
Must Your Highness treat me like this?

29:19.600 --> 29:23.120
I just feel that
every time you mention her,

29:23.200 --> 29:24.920
it's like you're talking
about Xue Fangfei.

29:25.480 --> 29:28.280
Is it a misunderstanding
on my part or yours?

29:28.920 --> 29:30.240
I killed Xue Fangfei,

29:30.320 --> 29:31.880
while your people killed Xue Huaiyuan.

29:31.960 --> 29:34.400
Now, Xue Fangfei is buried
under the ground, never rising again.

29:34.480 --> 29:35.960
But Xue Huaiyuan
is returning to the capital.

29:36.040 --> 29:38.880
Don't you think
you should give me an explanation instead?

29:39.840 --> 29:40.840
What did you say?

29:40.920 --> 29:42.120
Once Huaixiang's case is overturned,

29:42.200 --> 29:44.520
what Your Highness and Prince Cheng
have been doing might be exposed.

29:44.600 --> 29:46.680
At this point,
instead of considering the big picture,

29:46.760 --> 29:48.200
you're bothering me with a dead person!

29:50.240 --> 29:51.600
How dare you scold me.

29:57.760 --> 29:58.640
I apologize.

29:59.480 --> 30:01.840
I was impulsive
and offended Your Highness.

30:02.600 --> 30:03.880
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

30:03.960 --> 30:06.160
Don't think that
just because I teased you for a moment,

30:06.240 --> 30:08.200
you can control my affairs.

30:08.280 --> 30:12.160
You can't tell me what to do.

30:13.040 --> 30:13.880
Yes, Your Highness.

30:17.920 --> 30:20.840
Jiang Li must return quickly.

30:20.920 --> 30:23.920
I can't wait to meet her in person.

30:32.000 --> 30:33.000
FROM ZHOU DEZHAO: MS. JIANG LI
BROKE A PRISONER OUT ON THE STREET

30:33.080 --> 30:34.280
THIS CRIME IS EQUIVALENT TO TREASON,
PUNISHABLE BY DEATH BY A THOUSAND CUTS

30:35.600 --> 30:38.440
Read the memorial from the Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review.

30:43.160 --> 30:44.960
Is it similar to what Li Zhongnan wrote?

30:45.040 --> 30:47.680
Yes, but more detailed.

30:47.760 --> 30:49.640
It cites many criminal laws,

30:49.720 --> 30:52.040
wanting me to convict Ms. Jiang Li.

30:52.680 --> 30:54.280
Li Zhongnan is even more ruthless.

30:54.360 --> 30:57.080
Is he trying to use this chance
to convict Jiang Yuanbai too?

30:58.000 --> 30:59.000
What do you think?

30:59.080 --> 31:00.000
It's a bit difficult.

31:00.080 --> 31:01.720
Even you find it challenging too, right?

31:01.800 --> 31:04.320
I can easily refute
Li Zhongnan's memorial.

31:04.400 --> 31:07.280
After all, Jiang Li and Xue Huaiyuan
had just reached the capital.

31:07.360 --> 31:08.640
We haven't convicted her yet,

31:08.720 --> 31:10.240
so it's too early to talk
about collective punishment.

31:11.360 --> 31:13.120
But the one
from the Court of Judicial Review

31:14.040 --> 31:15.040
can't be delayed anymore.

31:15.120 --> 31:16.160
I must approve it today.

31:21.520 --> 31:22.360
Then do it.

31:23.960 --> 31:25.080
You're really calm about it.

31:27.640 --> 31:29.360
You should know that if we do this,

31:29.440 --> 31:33.000
your pawn will be thrown in prison.

31:33.080 --> 31:36.360
What is Your Majesty's view
on the phrase "valuing the people"?

31:36.440 --> 31:39.600
A sage's words should be followed.

31:46.640 --> 31:48.440
SMOOTH GOVERNANCE
AND HARMONIOUS SOCIETY

32:12.880 --> 32:13.800
My lord,

32:14.400 --> 32:16.600
how many times
have we watched shows from upstairs?

32:18.880 --> 32:19.960
What's up with his lordship?

32:20.520 --> 32:22.160
If you don't want to be hit, don't talk.

32:30.160 --> 32:31.880
It's proven that Ms. Jiang Li

32:31.960 --> 32:33.960
broke a death row prisoner
out of jail in Huaixiang

32:34.480 --> 32:37.120
and will be detained in the Court
of Judicial Review to await trial.

32:37.880 --> 32:38.920
Ms. Jiang Li,

32:39.000 --> 32:41.560
I'll take you and Xue Huaiyuan today.

32:42.120 --> 32:43.480
- I hope--
- Sir,

32:44.600 --> 32:47.400
I never intended to make things hard
for the Court of Judicial Review.

32:48.480 --> 32:50.200
Guards, take her away.

32:58.320 --> 32:59.920
- What are they doing?
- Right.

33:03.320 --> 33:04.240
Everyone,

33:05.200 --> 33:06.400
please listen to me.

33:07.360 --> 33:08.720
I did break a prisoner out of jail.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.600
By law, I should go to prison.

33:12.720 --> 33:14.720
But I, Jiang Li, have no regrets.

33:15.880 --> 33:17.360
I brought you all to the capital

33:17.440 --> 33:19.560
not to seek pardon for myself,

33:19.640 --> 33:22.440
but to bring your injustices

33:22.520 --> 33:23.840
to the ears of His Majesty.

33:24.880 --> 33:26.760
Our emperor is a just and righteous ruler.

33:27.240 --> 33:29.240
The injustice of Magistrate Xue

33:29.320 --> 33:30.400
and your injustices

33:30.480 --> 33:32.320
will surely be redressed for all to see!

33:32.880 --> 33:35.520
- Yes.
- Right.

33:41.280 --> 33:44.080
Sir, I have only one request.

33:44.640 --> 33:45.480
What is it?

33:46.040 --> 33:47.240
I want to strike…

33:52.040 --> 33:55.160
the capital's Admonishment Drum.

34:31.239 --> 34:34.239
It has been a long time
since anyone beat this Admonishment Drum.

34:34.320 --> 34:36.760
The last time the drum sound was heard
was over a decade ago.

34:37.280 --> 34:39.360
When was that?

34:39.440 --> 34:41.400
The time when General Xiao died.

34:48.000 --> 34:49.159
The Admonishment Drum

34:51.440 --> 34:52.560
on the platform

34:54.719 --> 34:55.880
at Chang'an Gate.

34:57.600 --> 34:59.640
The Magistrate of Huaixiang, Xue Huaiyuan,

35:00.880 --> 35:04.440
has always loved and cared
for the people like his own children,

35:04.520 --> 35:05.920
spending his entire fortune on them.

35:06.720 --> 35:08.680
However, he was framed by wicked people,

35:10.320 --> 35:11.640
falsely accused,

35:12.640 --> 35:14.200
and imprisoned, awaiting execution.

35:14.280 --> 35:18.240
I, Jiang Li, may just be a woman,

35:18.800 --> 35:20.560
but I can't bear
to see a loyal official wronged

35:20.640 --> 35:22.000
and a good man condemned to death.

35:23.040 --> 35:25.400
Today, I will strike the drum
at the city gate

35:25.480 --> 35:27.920
to seek justice for Xue Huaiyuan!

36:05.240 --> 36:08.280
May the wind carry the sound of the drum!

36:10.360 --> 36:13.840
May the heavens judge
between good and evil!

37:19.360 --> 37:22.680
Father!

37:28.080 --> 37:28.920
Stop it!

37:30.240 --> 37:32.480
- Father!
- You rascal! Get down here!

37:32.560 --> 37:33.680
What are you doing?

37:33.760 --> 37:35.240
My father died unjustly.

37:35.320 --> 37:37.040
I must seek justice for him.

37:37.120 --> 37:38.200
Father!

37:38.280 --> 37:39.800
Your father died in battle.

37:39.880 --> 37:41.760
- He is a hero of Great Yan!
- Father!

37:45.120 --> 37:47.480
- No, you're lying!
- Leave!

37:48.080 --> 37:49.000
Let me go!

37:49.480 --> 37:51.240
Put me down!

37:53.520 --> 37:55.880
You're lying! Put me down!

37:56.760 --> 37:57.920
Father!

38:07.120 --> 38:08.120
Forgive me.

38:10.560 --> 38:12.360
I can only help Magistrate Xue

38:14.080 --> 38:16.400
beat the Admonishment Drum.

38:29.920 --> 38:30.880
Let's go.

38:32.160 --> 38:33.000
Wait!

38:34.200 --> 38:35.720
Ms. Jiang Li, no need to apologize.

38:36.560 --> 38:37.520
We are still here.

38:44.800 --> 38:45.880
I'm illiterate.

38:46.360 --> 38:48.760
I'll just repeat what Ms. Jiang Li said.

38:49.640 --> 38:52.080
We seek justice for Magistrate Xue!

38:52.920 --> 38:55.120
May the wind carry the sound of the drum!

38:55.200 --> 38:57.800
