41:14.080 --> 41:14.920
Your Majesty.

41:15.480 --> 41:16.840
What's going on outside, Eunuch Su?

41:16.920 --> 41:19.080
It's the Admonishment Drum's sound
outside Chang'an Gate.

41:19.560 --> 41:20.480
Who's beating the drum?

41:20.560 --> 41:21.680
It's Ms. Jiang Li.

41:21.760 --> 41:23.920
Ms. Jiang Li struck
the Admonishment Drum three times,

41:24.000 --> 41:25.280
drawing a crowd of onlookers.

41:25.360 --> 41:26.600
Where's the Court
of Judicial Review's minister?

41:26.680 --> 41:28.520
He has already taken Ms. Jiang Li away.

41:28.600 --> 41:29.760
The ones beating the drums now

41:29.840 --> 41:31.880
are the people she brought from Huaixiang.

41:31.960 --> 41:32.960
Your Majesty, forgive me.

41:33.440 --> 41:34.320
It is my fault.

41:34.400 --> 41:36.640
My niece is really out of line.

41:38.000 --> 41:39.240
It has nothing to do with you.

41:41.240 --> 41:42.520
Get some rest.

41:42.600 --> 41:43.440
I will check it out.

41:56.960 --> 41:58.120
You're here pretty fast.

41:59.680 --> 42:00.680
So tell me.

42:01.160 --> 42:02.680
What's happening at Chang'an Gate now?

42:06.040 --> 42:06.880
Your Majesty,

42:06.960 --> 42:08.680
the Chief Secretariat is requesting

42:08.760 --> 42:09.880
an audience.

42:12.040 --> 42:12.880
What do you think?

42:13.480 --> 42:15.040
It's best not to see him now.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.680
Say I'm busy

42:17.760 --> 42:18.600
and tell him to go.

42:18.680 --> 42:19.600
Yes, Your Majesty.

42:24.440 --> 42:26.240
My teacher will feel uneasy

42:26.320 --> 42:28.000
when he goes home.

42:28.080 --> 42:29.240
So tell me.

42:29.320 --> 42:30.920
The Admonishment Drum
at Chang'an Gate was beaten.

42:31.000 --> 42:32.880
The Court of Judicial Review's minister
arrested her too.

42:32.960 --> 42:34.200
What should we do next

42:34.280 --> 42:36.760
to bring your pawn back to the game?

42:36.840 --> 42:37.920
Jiang Li isn't foolish.

42:38.000 --> 42:39.960
She has already prepared
a backup plan for herself.

42:40.040 --> 42:43.080
Her case and Xue Huaiyuan's case
will be investigated together.

42:43.160 --> 42:44.200
If his case is overturned,

42:44.280 --> 42:46.280
Xue Huaiyuan will be innocent.

42:46.360 --> 42:48.560
Then she didn't break
any prisoner out of jail.

42:51.080 --> 42:51.920
What's the matter?

42:53.360 --> 42:54.760
I find this quite interesting.

42:55.640 --> 42:58.800
Where did you find this pawn?

42:58.880 --> 42:59.840
I didn't find her.

43:00.760 --> 43:02.720
She came to me on her own.

43:03.360 --> 43:04.240
Not bad.

43:04.320 --> 43:05.440
She's a good pawn.

43:06.000 --> 43:08.000
You must have felt sentimental
when you heard

43:09.080 --> 43:10.440
the Admonishment Drum beaten today.

43:10.520 --> 43:11.720
Don't you, Your Majesty?

43:12.200 --> 43:13.040
Yes, I do.

43:13.520 --> 43:15.760
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

43:15.840 --> 43:18.040
After all, I've been waiting
for this day for a long time.

43:18.840 --> 43:20.760
Let's use this pawn

43:20.840 --> 43:22.720
to thoroughly clean up

43:23.560 --> 43:24.960
the imperial court of the Great Yan.

43:26.000 --> 43:26.920
Issue my decree.
